NONCROSSING_PARTITIONS=14
ORBIT_SIZES sigma=1 alpha=4 beta=2 gamma=2 delta=4 epsilon=1
sigma: D_coefficient = -r*(t - 1)
alpha: D_coefficient = 2*(t - 1)*(2*r*v - 2*r - v)
beta: D_coefficient = -(2*r - 1)*(t - 1)
gamma: D_coefficient = -2*(t - 1)*(v - 1)*(r*v - r - v)
delta: D_coefficient = -(t - 1)*(2*r*v**2 - 6*r*v + 4*r - v**2 + 4*v - 2)
epsilon: D_coefficient = -(r - 1)*(t - 1)*(v - 1)**2
FACTORIZATION_PASS: D(r,t,v)=(1-t)Q(r,v)
dQ/dr sigma: 1
dQ/dr alpha: -4*(v - 1)
dQ/dr beta: 2
dQ/dr gamma: 2*(v - 1)**2
dQ/dr delta: 2*(v - 2)*(v - 1)
dQ/dr epsilon: (v - 1)**2
MONOTONIC_NEAR_EDGE_PASS: all dQ/dr orbit coefficients are >=0 on v in [0,1]
HOMOGENEOUS_SPECIALIZATION_PASS
ALL_EXACT_CHECKS_PASS
